    "created_at": "2016-11-15T22:41:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-15T22:41:04Z",
    "body": "My understanding is that many, many websites use this feature, and we cannot remove it as doing so would break the web. Any security here has to be opt-in, via the noopener rel, which is I assume what you are referring to as a clumsy workaround.\n\nOthers may know more, e.g. @mikewest.\n",
