    "created_at": "2016-11-21T19:25:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-21T19:25:02Z",
    "body": "My understanding is that this is widely used for OAuth consent flows, where a popup is created to show the site from which permissions are accepted with the full https address bar.  The user accepts the permission grant, and then window.opener.location is used to advance the original window to the next step in the flow with a reference to the newly created oauth token.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
